      <marc:subfield code="a">One piece of paper... twelve lives changed forever.... Shortly before the car accident, Kate wrote the simple words of Psalm 23 on a piece of paper to give to her wayward and confused son. When a lonely dry-cleaning employee finds Kate&apos;s humble, handwritten copy of the psalm, it begins an incredible journey around the world, forever changing the lives of twelve very different people. From a soldier wounded in Iraq to a Kenyan runner about to begin the Rome Invitational Marathon, the power of the ancient words begins to shape lives. When Kate&apos;s paper makes it back to its starting place, she discovers the unexpected ways that God moves and changes lives through even our smallest actions.</marc:subfield>
